      "widgets_values": [
        "WF2 - BUILD THE SfM DATASET FROM THE UPSCALED PANORAMAS\n\nRun AFTER 2b1_upscale_panorama_frames has finished writing frames.\n\n1. Point 'Load UPSCALED panoramas' at <dataset>/panoramas_upscaled (the folder WF1\n   wrote, e.g. D:\\comfy\\ComfyUI\\output\\dark-alley-02\\panoramas_upscaled).\n2. Set output_name on the SphereSfM node to the SAME dataset name you used at\n   generation (mode=panorama_only) so the COLMAP dataset lands in the right folder.\n3. face_size = 0 keeps the cube faces at full detail derived from the 8K panoramas\n   (full-8K training, as requested).\n\nRAM: SphereSfM concatenates every frame into one array. 81 x 8192x4096 is heavy\n(tens of GB) - if it OOMs, lower the loader's resolution or set a non-zero face_size\ninstead of feeding native 8K. The upscaled frames stay safe on disk regardless."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
